          "subtitle": "Aug 2017 - Aug 2017",
          "subComponenets": [
            {
              "description": [
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Panda Escape was a Ionic Mobile App (adapted into a Progressive Web App as well) developed in a couple of days for a high-school hackathon. The app placed 3rd in the competition.\n\n(The app is best viewed on a mobile phone since it was designed for mobile phones)"
                }
